recently, which was crazy.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:13.493
- I did.

00:01:13.493 --> 00:01:14.326
- But you're good now, right?

00:01:14.326 --> 00:01:15.436
- I'm good now-

00:01:15.436 --> 00:01:16.290
