God is good, I'm good.

00:01:31.589 --> 00:01:33.714
I cleared all of that.
(audience applauds)

00:01:33.714 --> 00:01:34.714
I'm good!
- Isn't it crazy?

00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:36.670
The unknown is what freaks me out.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:37.620
- Yeah!
- The unknown.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.090
I'm like, "What's happening in there?"

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:39.923
- Anyway-
- Man!

00:01:39.923 --> 00:01:42.360
- So comedy, as a kid,

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.320
who are your influences?

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.153
'Cause you're hilarious.

00:01:44.153 --> 00:01:45.437
- Oh man, Martin Lawrence.

00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:47.790
- Oh my god, love him.
- Richard Pryor.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:48.780
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.389
- John Ritter, the list goes on and on-

00:01:51.389 --> 00:01:52.637
- "Three's Company," okay, yeah.

00:01:52.637 --> 00:01:54.396
- "Three's Company," yeah.
- I love it, yeah.

00:01:54.396 --> 00:01:56.683
- I love John Ritter.
(audience applauds)

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:57.516
- Yeah, man!

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.100
- I love Martin Lawrence too, man.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.420
He had such a great show.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.500
- Martin Lawrence is amazing,

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.300
