00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.790
You've had such a relationship
established for so long.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.290
- Oh, yes.
- Do you improvise a ton?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.510
- A ton, and then we we're
using the same writers

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:25.343
from the first one,

00:03:25.343 --> 00:03:27.060
so they know that we're gonna improvise.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.610
And so we do that all the time.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:29.443
(audience laughs)

00:03:29.443 --> 00:03:31.619
Oh, look at us!
(all laugh)

00:03:31.619 --> 00:03:32.520
- The babies.
- Our first day

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.740
