00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.040
and he's just looking at me, (laughs)

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:41.873
he can't take it.

00:03:41.873 --> 00:03:42.706
We laughed through the whole thing.

00:03:42.706 --> 00:03:43.539
Can't take it seriously.
(audience laughs)

00:03:43.539 --> 00:03:44.940
- It was the longest first day ever,

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.020
'cause we just kept cracking up

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.580
