00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.413
It was just-
- He's like,

00:03:48.413 --> 00:03:49.246
"Nope, can't take it."

00:03:49.246 --> 00:03:50.079
- "Nope, I can't take it.

00:03:50.079 --> 00:03:51.757
"Look at how Kel looks." (laughs)

00:03:51.757 --> 00:03:53.644
