it's like he's thinking.

00:03:53.644 --> 00:03:56.490
Do people ask y'all to rate their burgers?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.850
- Yes, all the time.
- I imagine.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:00.720
