- Okay, so,

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.540
I love them all,

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:58.770
'cause I don't want them to get mad at me.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:04:59.603
So I love them all.

00:04:59.603 --> 00:05:03.030
But it's one spot called
Billionaire Burger Boyz.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.410
- Billionaire Burger Boyz.
- Billionaire Burger Boyz,

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.750
